{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"body":"Fix implemented and pushed: Gerrit change 1803 (https://rebar.solutions.navateam.com/c/rebar/+/1803), commit 287505d4ff.\n\n**Change**: replaced the bare substring assertion in test_notice_names_pandoc_its_version_and_its_licence with a module-level scheme+host-anchored regex:\n\n    _UPSTREAM_RE = re.compile(\n        r\"https?://(www\\.)?pandoc\\.org(?![\\w.-])|https?://github\\.com/jgm/pandoc(?![\\w-])\"\n    )\n    assert _UPSTREAM_RE.search(text), (...)\n\n**RED demonstration** (executed): the old expression accepted both https://notpandoc.org (prefix lookalike) and https://pandoc.org.evil.com (suffix lookalike — the case \\b would still pass, per the plan-review blocker); the anchored regex rejects both plus a schemeless bare 'pandoc.org' mention, and still accepts the real NOTICE (all 4 tests in the file pass).\n\n**Sibling sweep**: alert #88 is the ONLY open code-scanning alert repo-wide (gh api confirmed). Grep for URL/hostname substring-in checks found no other same-class occurrences: remaining matches are scheme-anchored full-URL literals (test_release_workflow_pins, test_ci_tickets_partial_clone_workflows, test_canary_bridge), error-message assertions on example.com addresses, or doc-content mentions (test_harness_shims checks 'developers.openai.com/codex' appears in a docs string — not a URL-sanitization pattern, unflagged by CodeQL, left alone). No new tickets needed.\n\n**Gates**: pytest tests/unit/test_notice_records_pandoc_gpl.py — 4 passed; make lint — pass; make typecheck — pass (543 files, no issues). Version pins and NOTICE content untouched (diff is 10+/2- in the one test file).\n\nAwaiting LLM-Review +1 and Verified +1 on change 1803; ticket stays in_progress until the change merges."},"env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","event_type":"COMMENT","timestamp":1786765459867008001,"uuid":"d155764a-f49e-436c-b792-7a574769c6f6"}